---
---
<section class="relative min-h-dvh flex items-center justify-start pt-20 overflow-hidden group">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580582932707-520aed937b7b?w=1920&q=90"
      alt=""
      role="presentation"
      fetchpriority="high"
      width="1920"
      height="1080"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center motion-safe:scale-105 motion-safe:group-hover:scale-100 motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-[20s] motion-safe:ease-out"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-primary/90 via-primary/70 to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/20"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary/20 border border-secondary/50 text-secondary px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide mb-6 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 duration-500">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary inline-block"></span>
        Educação Infantil ao 9º ano
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-8 duration-700">
        <span class="text-secondary">Educação com valores, excelência e formação para o futuro do seu filho</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/90 mb-10 max-w-xl font-light leading-relaxed animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-8 duration-700">
        Aqui, cada aluno é acolhido, orientado e preparado para crescer com conhecimento, fé e responsabilidade.
      </p>

      <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-8 duration-700">
        {[
          "Formação integral: acadêmica, humana e emocional",
          "Ambiente seguro e acolhedor",
          "Equipe comprometida com cada aluno",
        ].map((item) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/90 text-sm">
            <span class="text-secondary font-bold shrink-0">✔</span>
            {item}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
